/tmp/tmp.y7X5pe7ToP/Parameters.tex:5:We apply our idea of Enhanced MinRank-Niederreiter encryption frame by taking a Gabidulin code $\mathcal{G}[m,k]_{q^m}$, for which we know an efficient decoding algorithm, allowing to decode errors of weight up to $\lfloor \frac{m-k}{2} \rfloor$. As we previously said, decrypting the ciphertext $\Yv$ without the secret key $\sk$ is strictly equivalent to the MinRank problem of parameters $(q,m+\ell_1,m+\ell_2,km,r)$. 
